{"unit_id":"dlpufan__yuhao-pet#card-zh","repo":"dlpufan/yuhao-pet","commit":"f6991f72ccbe737d32f863a99f5e8e1cf02e0a83","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"宇昊桌面宠物是面向 DSH Web 的互动桌面角色，通过 shell.overlay 插槽显示可拖动的宠物，并由服务端状态和路由驱动。用户可以查看饱食、清洁、心情、健康与精力，投喂、玩耍、洗澡、用药、学习、打工、睡觉、购物和互动；宠物也支持聊天、表情立绘、历史记录及 token 积分。适合希望在 Web 工作界面加入养成陪伴体验的用户。AI 对话需在设置中填写 DeepSeek API Key，聊天内容会发送至 DeepSeek。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1080-1085","index.mjs:482-503","index.mjs:417-429"]}
{"unit_id":"dlpufan__yuhao-pet#card-en","repo":"dlpufan/yuhao-pet","commit":"f6991f72ccbe737d32f863a99f5e8e1cf02e0a83","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Yuhao Desktop Pet adds a draggable interactive character to the DSH Web overlay. Users can check five stats, care for the pet, study, work, shop, interact, and chat. It stores pet state locally and can earn points from token usage. AI chat requires a DeepSeek API key and sends messages to DeepSeek.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1080-1085","index.mjs:482-503","index.mjs:417-429"]}
